WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.110
If your prep is ClenPIQ, this video will walk you through exactly how to

2
00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:04.680
take it.

3
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.960
Just follow along step by step.

4
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:11.000
Your ClenPIQ prep comes as two small, ready-to-drink bottles.

5
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.560
You'll drink each bottle straight.

6
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.280
The day before your colonoscopy, between 5 and 9 p.m.,

7
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.360
you'll drink your first bottle of ClenPIQ right from the bottle.

8
00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:24.570
After you finish it, drink five cups of clear liquid over the next three to

9
00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:25.360
five hours.

10
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:29.240
Remember, no red, orange, blue, or purple liquids.

11
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:33.680
For your second dose, six hours before your procedure time, drink your second

12
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.080
bottle of ClenPIQ.

13
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:39.600
After finishing it, drink eight ounces of clear liquid every 15 minutes.

14
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.400
This totals 32 ounces over one hour.

15
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.760
If your procedure is scheduled for early morning, you will need to get up

16
00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.200
during the night to take this second dose.

17
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.680
The correct timing of this dose is essential to an effective preparation.

18
00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:58.760
Do not have any liquids at all within four hours of your procedure.

19
00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.760
This part is really important.

20
00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:05.190
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed, even if you're already

21
00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.520
passing clear liquid.

22
00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:10.480
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

23
00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.600
the clearest view during your procedure.

24
00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.900
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither

25
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:17.960
of us wants that.

26
00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:21.400
Drink as many clear liquids as possible throughout the process.

27
00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:24.520
Hydration is important, and it's actually part of the prep.

28
00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:28.360
Make sure to hydrate before you take the prep, while you're taking the prep,

29
00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:30.440
but nothing after your second dose.

30
00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:34.040
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom,

31
00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:38.040
applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

32
00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.800
That's it, you've got this.

33
00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:44.280
Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay hydrated.

34
00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:47.720
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office.

35
00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:48.920
We're here to help.
